Z||000002||Oreif||02-08-2000||01:40 AM||||For those of you interested every year our Illinois club has a "Fierorama" which is a fiero show for fiero's. The only cars that get judged are the "daily drivers" The custom and mod cars just show-off. It's part of the "Northen Illinos Fiero Enthusiasts"<BR>We have our own website that you can monitor all the years event's. In April we go to Loda Illinois for a spring show at Twin Lakes Fiero. Lots of cars to see and acres of parts to buy. The Fiero rama is in September and there are a few other get togethers throughout the year. Also there is a big get together in The Wisconsin Dells! That is where the Illinois, Michigan, Wisconsin, and Minnisota clubs meet for an entire weekend of shows, tech talks, and cruising! For those interested I can get you dates and also contacts to participate.||||reg||1
