Z||000011||Oreif||02-10-2000||01:36 AM||||First the April show doesn't have a date set as of yet. Hopefully by the end of the month. Loda and Paxton are next to each other Bob's original warehouse is in Loda and the big one is in Paxton. For those interested I'm in Schaumburg.<BR>To join the Northern Illinois Fiero Enthusiasts contact Paul Vargyas at: paulv@xnet.com He is the membership Director of the club. It is the 3rd largest Fiero club in the country. Dues are $20 per year.<BR>The club website is: <A HREF="http://www.xnet.com/~nife" TARGET=_blank>http://www.xnet.com/~nife</A> <P>||||reg||1
