Z||000013||Old Lar||02-11-2000||04:39 PM||||I spoke with Bob yesterday, and he said the show at Twin Lakes Fiero was May 6.  I'm a long way away, but Bob is working on both my cars now.  One is done the other will be done soon.<P>The Dells run 2000 is June 1-4.  Fun show. Register early.||||reg||1
